# Privacy Policy for Smart Calculator

**Effective Date:** August 21, 2026

RahiVerse Studio ("we", "our", or "us") developed and operates the **Smart Calculator** mobile application ("App").

We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the App.

## 1. Information We Collect

Smart Calculator does not collect, store, or share personal information from users.

The App does not require you to create an account or provide personal information such as your name, email address, phone number, address, or other identifying information.

## 2. Calculator Data

Calculations and numbers entered into the calculator are used only to perform the requested calculations.

The App does not transmit your calculation history or entered numbers to our servers.

## 3. Device Permissions

Smart Calculator does not require access to sensitive device permissions such as:

* Contacts
* Location
* Camera
* Microphone
* Phone calls
* SMS
* Photos or files

The App only uses permissions that are necessary for its basic functionality, if any.

## 4. Third-Party Services

Smart Calculator does not knowingly collect or share personal information through third-party services.

If third-party services are added to the App in the future, this Privacy Policy will be updated accordingly.

## 5. Data Security

Because Smart Calculator does not collect or transmit personal information to our servers, we do not maintain a database of users' personal information.

We nevertheless take reasonable measures to maintain the security and integrity of the App.

## 6. Children's Privacy

Smart Calculator does not knowingly collect personal information from children or any other users.

Because the App does not require users to provide personal information, no personal information is knowingly collected from children through the App.

## 7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes to the App or applicable requirements.

Any updated Privacy Policy will be made available through the location where this Privacy Policy is published.

